       "content": "Earlier this month I had the opportunity to speak at PepsiCo HQ for their #Womenshistorymonth kickoff alongside Elaine San Jose & Kyle Watson. \n\nI am incredibly grateful to have been included in this conversation and to share more about my career journey and experiences at Alani Nutrition. It is surreal to think back on the immense growth we have seen as a brand, and that I have experienced, both personally and professionally, in this role over the last 5 years. \n\nThis opportunity reminded me that we aren't just building a community around the brand, but are also building a bold community within it. \n\nA big thank you to the Women\u2019s ERGs at PepsiCo for having us!",
