       "content": "Fort Lauderdale Spring Break + Alani Nu Lime Slush = a winning combination! \n\nYesterday our team launched the \u201cSlush Stop\u201d activation at Fort Lauderdale Beach, giving thousands of Spring Breakers their first taste of our latest limited-time flavor.\n\nThe creativity and execution from our team is truly inspiring \u2014 from the immersive setup to the energy on the ground.\n\nSeeing consumers experience the brand in real life like this is what makes activations like these so meaningful. Momentum like this reinforces why we\u2019re so excited about what\u2019s ahead for Alani Nutrition.\n\nHead to Las Olas Beach in Fort Lauderdale - today only - and check it out! hashtag #AlaniNu #LimeSlush",
